cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Beelzebub's Tales: A Citable Edition of Gurdjieff's All and Everything First Series"
abstract: >-
  A schema-documented, MIT-licensed republication of G. I. Gurdjieff's
  *Beelzebub's Tales to His Grandson* (1950), with paragraph-level anchors
  preserved from the joshuatilton/Vellum 2019 typesetting, and a reference
  Progressive Web App reader. The underlying English text is in the public
  domain; this project provides programmable infrastructure for citation,
  cross-reference, and downstream reuse.
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: sajad2025
    affiliation: "Independent"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sajad2025/beelzebub"
url: "https://sajad2025.github.io/beelzebub/"
