  - digital humanities
  - cultural heritage
  - public domain
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-05-18"
references:
  - type: book
    title: "Beelzebub's Tales to His Grandson (All and Everything, First Series)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Gurdjieff
        given-names: G. I.
    year: 1950
    publisher:
      name: "Routledge & Kegan Paul"
    notes: >-
      Primary text. The English first edition entered the public domain in
      life+70 jurisdictions in 2020. This project republishes the underlying
      text via a 2019 retypeset PDF whose page anchors are preserved as a
      citation system.
